{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31721","headline":"辞二知己 · 贾岛","name":"辞二知己","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一双千岁鹤，立别孤翔鸿。\n波岛忽已暮，海雨寒蒙蒙。\n离人闻美弹，亦与哀弹同。\n况兹切切弄，绕彼行行躬。\n云飞北岳碧，火息西山红。\n何以代远诚，折芳腊雪中。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贾岛","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31721.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31721","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}